{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with the Revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy the &quot;Supporter Pack DLC&quot; to support my work and get more weapons to play with: Machine Gun, Bow, Carbine, Coach Gun, Repeater, Dual Pistols and Dynamite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: STORY :::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outlaws aren't too happy about you jailing their leader, Sheriff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're all over town. Grab your six-shooter and clear them out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: STRAIGHTFORWARD NON-STOP ACTION :::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfight your way through procedurally generated Wild West towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rid of all outlaws or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: CUSTOMIZE GAMEPLAY MECHANICS :::</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a bunch of options that modify different aspects of how the game mechanics work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to shape the difficulty to suit your playstyle and skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want the gunfights to require hardcore skill or just be casual?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What reaction time should outlaws have, and how well do they aim?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want projectiles to be affected by gravity? Should damage account for velocity?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the amount of health you have and if it regenerates after a specified time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should reloading be realistic, fast, or not even needed?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2835310?t=1770378866","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2835310?t=1770378866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835310/8ead4cde8a9aaa8410f415e2fd6cae685a771026/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770378866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835310/8ead4cde8a9aaa8410f415e2fd6cae685a771026/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770378866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood effects when hitting enemies that splatters the enviroment. Bullet wounds on bodies. Dismemberment. All can be disabled."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with the Revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy the &quot;Supporter Pack DLC&quot; to support my work and get more weapons to play with: Machine Gun, Bow, Carbine, Coach Gun, Repeater, Dual Pistols and Dynamite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: STORY :::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outlaws aren't too happy about you jailing their leader, Sheriff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're all over town. Grab your six-shooter and clear them out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: STRAIGHTFORWARD NON-STOP ACTION :::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfight your way through procedurally generated Wild West towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rid of all outlaws or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>::: CUSTOMIZE GAMEPLAY MECHANICS :::</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a bunch of options that modify different aspects of how the game mechanics work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to shape the difficulty to suit your playstyle and skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want the gunfights to require hardcore skill or just be casual?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What reaction time should outlaws have, and how well do they aim?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want projectiles to be affected by gravity? Should damage account for velocity?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the amount of health you have and if it regenerates after a specified time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should reloading be realistic, fast, or not even needed?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p></li></ul>","developers":["Stolpskott Studios"],"dlc":[3275900],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835310/header.jpg?t=1770378866","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2835310/1376528829/0e50833ae240b7b85a23122d8309968765ded0ae/1770378054/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770378865","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2835310/1376528829/0e50833ae240b7b85a23122d8309968765ded0ae/1770378054/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770378865","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2835310/1376528829/0e50833ae240b7b85a23122d8309968765ded0ae/1770378054/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770378865","id":257113536,"name":"Revolver","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113536/11b8aff2896f6c7a087e1428ab1d3cbefbc54639/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770378865"}],"name":"Sharpshooter","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 Cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX, Shader Model 4 compatible<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><